      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "SETTLED  \u00b7  lesson as it stands; photocopy for practice; blue book for the exam; margin question (C) for the in-lesson checkpoint.\n\nBLUE BOOK  \u00b7  interior on a strict 30px rhythm so type sits on the rules, red vertical margin, spine shadow on both leaves. Closed book, then opened; the page turn between them is motion, not layout.\n\nCHECKPOINT C AT 390px  \u00b7  three reductions, since the margin does not exist on a phone. P1 lead-in line, P2 tinted band, P3 the brass rule becomes the container.\n\nPARKED, NOT DISCARDED  \u00b7  legal pad for v1.1 notes (already a WONT in PLAN.md); index card for a later use; torn slip stays with homework."
    },
